    <!-- Privacy Activity -->
    <string name="title_privacy">Privacy Notice &amp; Data Control</string>
    <string name="privacy_summary">Smart Keyboard AI Menu respects your privacy:\n\n1. Local Keystroke Processing: Typing, suggestions, and autocorrect run 100% locally on your device. Keystrokes are NEVER transmitted to remote servers.\n2. Password Protection: Sensitive and password fields strictly disable suggestions, AI features, and logging.\n3. Explicit AI Actions: Text is sent to your configured AI provider ONLY when you deliberately tap an AI action button.\n4. No Background Telemetry: No analytics SDKs, no ad trackers, no background logging.\n5. Clipboard Security: The clipboard is accessed only when you explicitly tap Paste or open the Clipboard panel.\n6. Client-Side Secrets Notice: Keys are stored via Android Keystore. Devices with compromised root may expose memory; using a self-hosted relay or private proxy is recommended for production.</string>
    <string name="btn_clear_history">Clear Learned Words &amp; Local History</string>
